<title>BELGIUM: TRADE IN UCO SHARES SUSPENDED - BRUSSELS BOURSE.</title>
<headline>TRADE IN UCO SHARES SUSPENDED - BRUSSELS BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels bourse has suspended trade in shares of UCO NV pending a statement, the Bourse said on Monday.</p>
<p>UCO is a Ghent-based textile company.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
